## Proposed Changes

### Arguments

#### [MODIFY] [arguments.h](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/OneDrive/Documents/antigravity/elec_vdw/arguments.h)
Add to struct (after `msm_run_its`):
```cpp
// LLPS module
bool   flag_llps;
float  llps_rcut;        // contact cutoff nm (default 0.7)
float  llps_perc_thr;    // percolation threshold (default 0.5)
int    llps_maxlag;      // max lag frames for C(t) (default 500)
bool   llps_contacts;    // enable residue contact map
std::string llps_sticker_beads; // comma-sep bead names (default "BB,SC1,SC2,BB1,BB2,BB3,SC3,SC4")
```
Add to constructor defaults: `flag_llps{false}, llps_rcut{0.7f}, llps_perc_thr{0.5f}, llps_maxlag{500}, llps_contacts{false}, llps_sticker_beads{"BB,SC1,SC2,BB1,BB2,BB3,SC3,SC4"}`

#### [MODIFY] [arguments.cpp](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/OneDrive/Documents/antigravity/elec_vdw/arguments.cpp)
Parse new flags in [parse_arguments()](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/OneDrive/Documents/antigravity/elec_vdw/parse_arguments.cpp#14-588):
```
-llps              → flag_llps = true
-llps-rcut FLOAT   → llps_rcut
-llps-perc FLOAT   → llps_perc_thr
-llps-maxlag INT   → llps_maxlag
-llps-contacts     → llps_contacts = true
-llps-sticker STR  → llps_sticker_beads
```

