### Integration

#### [MODIFY] [impl_engine.cpp](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/OneDrive/Documents/antigravity/elec_vdw/impl_engine.cpp)
3 insertion points:

**1. Include + declaration (~line 272):**
```cpp
#include "titan_llps.h"
std::unique_ptr<TitanLLPS> llps_analyzer;
```

**2. Init block (after Martini topology parse, `~line 595`):**
```cpp
if (Arguments.flag_llps && !llps_analyzer) {
    auto chain_beads = build_chain_bead_index(mol, Arguments);  // helper
    llps_analyzer = std::make_unique<TitanLLPS>(
        (int)chain_beads.size(), chain_beads,
        Arguments.llps_rcut, Arguments.llps_perc_thr, Arguments.llps_contacts);
    llps_analyzer->set_sticker_beads(mol.info, Arguments.llps_sticker_beads);
}
```

**3. Hot loop (after coordinates loaded per-frame):**
```cpp
if (Arguments.flag_llps && llps_analyzer) {
    llps_analyzer->process_frame(
        reinterpret_cast<const float*>(traj.x),
        traj.box, traj.time * 0.001f, (int)global_frame_counter);
}
```

**4. Post-loop finalize + export:**
```cpp
if (Arguments.flag_llps && llps_analyzer) {
    llps_analyzer->finalize(static_cast<int>(num_threads), Arguments.llps_maxlag);
    llps_analyzer->export_results(info_output, log);
}
```

